<%- include('components/header') %>
<%- include('components/title', { text: 'Your account is', emphasis: 'deactivated' }) %>
<%- include('components/greetings') %>
<p>We've signed you out and deactivated your Memento account. It will be permanently deleted on <strong><%= scheduledFor %></strong>.</p>
<p>Changed your mind? Sign in before then and your account will be restored exactly as it was.</p>
<%- include('components/btn-link', { title: 'Sign in to restore', url: appUrl, showUrl: false }) %>
<p class="small muted">If you didn't delete your account, sign in right away to restore it, then change your password.</p>
<%- include('components/closing-text') %>
<%- include('components/footer') %>
